{"ref":"core-es:item:000623","lang":"en","text":"On Saturdays I start the day at nine.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000624","lang":"en","text":"First, I drink coffee and eat bread.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000625","lang":"en","text":"Afterwards, I clean the house and wash the clothes.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000626","lang":"en","text":"At eleven, I leave home and go to the park.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000627","lang":"en","text":"There I read a book.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000521","lang":"en","text":"I live in a small flat with two bedrooms.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000522","lang":"en","text":"The kitchen is big and has a very tall window.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000523","lang":"en","text":"My room is always clean.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000524","lang":"en","text":"There's no garden, but there's a square nearby.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000525","lang":"en","text":"I like living here a lot.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000526","lang":"en","text":"I work in an office in the centre.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000527","lang":"en","text":"I arrive at nine and read my emails.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000528","lang":"en","text":"I have a meeting with my boss at eleven.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000529","lang":"en","text":"I have lunch with a friend at one.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000530","lang":"en","text":"I finish at six and come home tired.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000531","lang":"en","text":"On Saturday I don't work.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000532","lang":"en","text":"In the morning I clean the house and do the laundry.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000533","lang":"en","text":"Then I go to the market to buy fruit and vegetables.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000534","lang":"en","text":"In the afternoon I play football with my friends.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000535","lang":"en","text":"In the evening we have dinner together at a restaurant.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000536","lang":"en","text":"Yesterday I didn't feel well.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000537","lang":"en","text":"My head hurt and I had a fever.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000538","lang":"en","text":"I couldn't sleep at night.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000539","lang":"en","text":"This morning I went to the doctor.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000540","lang":"en","text":"He gave me some medicine and now I'm better.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000541","lang":"en","text":"Last summer we travelled to Mexico.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000542","lang":"en","text":"We went by plane and arrived at night.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000543","lang":"en","text":"The hotel was near the beach.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000544","lang":"en","text":"Every day we ate fish and drank orange juice.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000545","lang":"en","text":"It was a lovely trip.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000546","lang":"en","text":"I go to the market on Thursdays.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000547","lang":"en","text":"I buy apples, tomatoes and onions.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000548","lang":"en","text":"The fish is delicious.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000549","lang":"en","text":"Everything costs little and the people are very kind.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000550","lang":"en","text":"I pay by card and go home with two bags.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000551","lang":"en","text":"It's been raining a lot since yesterday.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000552","lang":"en","text":"The sky is grey and it's windy.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000553","lang":"en","text":"I can't cycle to work.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000554","lang":"en","text":"I go by train and read the newspaper.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000555","lang":"en","text":"But tomorrow it's going to be sunny.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000556","lang":"en","text":"Good morning, what would you like?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000557","lang":"en","text":"A coffee with milk, please.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000558","lang":"en","text":"Anything else?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000559","lang":"en","text":"Yes, a biscuit. How much is it?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000560","lang":"en","text":"Three euros.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000561","lang":"en","text":"Thank you.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000593","lang":"en","text":"Good afternoon. What are you going to have?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000594","lang":"en","text":"A tea with milk, please.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000595","lang":"en","text":"Would you like a biscuit too?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000596","lang":"en","text":"No, thank you. Just the tea.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000597","lang":"en","text":"That's two euros.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000598","lang":"en","text":"Here you are. Thank you very much.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000599","lang":"en","text":"Excuse me, where is the bank?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000600","lang":"en","text":"It's nearby. Turn left at the pharmacy.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000601","lang":"en","text":"Is the bank far away?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000602","lang":"en","text":"No, it's five minutes away.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000603","lang":"en","text":"Perfect, thank you very much.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000562","lang":"en","text":"Do you need any help?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000563","lang":"en","text":"I'm looking for a black jacket.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000564","lang":"en","text":"What size are you?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000565","lang":"en","text":"I don't know. Can I try this one on?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000566","lang":"en","text":"Of course, it's over there.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000567","lang":"en","text":"I'll take this one. How much is it?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000568","lang":"en","text":"Thirty euros.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:000604","lang":"en","text":"Good afternoon, what are you looking for?","type":"natural"}
